<description>&lt;p&gt;The 92‑year-old federal judge overseeing the Maduro drug-trafficking case has died and a new judge has been appointed as Maduro returns to federal court to face torture allegations. A soldier who allegedly bet $400,000 on Maduro’s removal has been arrested, and another soldier is under investigation for insider trading on Polymarket. Explosive attacks near the Colombia-Venezuela border injured police officers and civilians in two separate blasts. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2007.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPMTlvMlFLS3dOcXlXRmV3eFdaeVFlZlJ5V0xoZkFiRGw3Zm1LX3FTa3RrWUhOWlk0SzRUUzNJeGVuMVVrTkt2bzR1ZWp3by1Bb1NybkhGbUhaRmpwWTRLVU5ENnl6OFdxM0Y2YnFvV3JXb1NuY09TUHl3S0pISzh0em1aR0s?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxOeTBNZmo2b0pVVThZWWc5N3c5eFFvWkpIV25SZzRPdDAyaUExeTRsb3dhMUxKRHVTUFdsazhsRVVYWTYxZkpjVU5mTEgxQXl4NUN4OXVwcFF3OEZtQ2NYZ0N1VlExTGw5TDZuR0ZTMkFOeHNnTk0zcjh3azhLbDFLeFZLQ2swVXRXUFRBN29YUjdDaHhENHBCUEhtblBid1JRVEE1VFJVaUkzZzR4bFRZSUJVU1NBWERycUxYUmNiTVljUDc0Wnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNQngzVl9mYXFKRU13TkJRMUdMakg5SnVXUk9kME9rOW1NVU9BNFY1Ulp6RGZ0OF91N2RERmxVZGNTXzNMVlB2WUg5TFNUZC1SdGJTQWYxakowVk1KMW82TlFFbFYzMUhVMk9GZVhWa3RuajNUbV96MDB2NHFYTS1VR1Y2Q3YwWUVGdUN1cW9iQUJWQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxONmdvU0ltZmJGYVpaUGMwRFg1R3M0NTFuVlpoUllCc1dfeDZLQmpJOTFzYWJWb0ViMUdsa0VHNjJrdHg1ZWg4WjdwRFVVVUlRd0xyUGNWTFZtSUwxZlN0R1Eyb0xJXzBvSGF3bV8tWl9hRDk1Y1ItRGtMSnM2U2QzSTNudk1HV1U?oc=5&quot;&gt;Futurism&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQU3hjajFxTWJRTEF5QW44VlNFWE5BVy1XZFRlQXBKZU5KVFowai0tbjl